ons_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yugabyte-ci/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2024-01-26T16:44:53Z","label":{"name":"kind/enhancement","color":"c2e0c6"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1936816555","html_url":"https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/20795#issuecomment-1936816555","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/20795","id":1936816555,"node_id":"IC_kwDOBlCVUc5zcXmr","user":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-10T02:18:22Z","updated_at":"2024-02-10T02:18:22Z","body":"According to internal link https://detective-gcp.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=master&build_type=all&class=PgBackendsTestRf3BlockNoLeaderLock&fail_tag=all&name=LeaderChangeInFlightNegative%2F0&num_commits=500&platform=linux, the failure rate got worse and worse over time.  The failure reason I have diagnosed to be based on timing: the slower the execution of one thread, the more likely the failure.  It appears to be passing much more often in 2.20 branch's centos-clang16-tsan compared to alma8-clang17-tsan on master: only one failure (internal link https://detective-gcp.dev.yugabyte.com/stability/test?analyze_trends=true&branch=2.20&build_type=all&class=PgBackendsTestRf3BlockNoLeaderLock&fail_tag=all&name=LeaderChangeInFlightNegative%2F0&num_commits=500&platform=linux).  The difference in build types might play a role, but I think a bad commit in master is more likely.  This test could be used to find that bad commit, but it would take a lot of time.\r\n\r\nThe first failure on master in the last 500 commits is 05e1d44e.  I would pick a modest lower bound of 67ebdfb7 and upper bound of that 30d4173d (second failure) for a potential performance degradation that happened in master.\r\n\r\nThere was a second spike in failure rate increase around af01dc07.  I would pick a lower bound of e29e50fe for that.\r\n\r\nThere appears to be a third increase at around 4e7ddc1b, lower bound f900ea5b.\r\n\r\nAnd a fourth around 03c9c4ca.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/issues/comments/1936816555/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"jasonyb","id":93959687,"node_id":"U_kgDOBZm2Bw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93959687?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb","html_url":"https://github.com/jasonyb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jasonyb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaso